# Country pathway routing.
# Each rule proxies a path to where that page is actually hosted. Status 200 =
# transparent rewrite (URL bar stays at goocampusevents.com). `!` = force,
# overrides any local file.
# NOTE: amc-pathway & nz-pathway are Astro sites deployed on GitHub Pages
# (astro base = /amc-pathway, /nz-pathway). Their old *.netlify.app targets are
# dead (404), so these proxy to GitHub Pages instead.

/amc-pathway/*  https://beast-clone.github.io/amc-pathway/:splat  200!
/nz-pathway/*   https://beast-clone.github.io/nz-pathway/:splat   200!
/gc-dashboard/* https://goocampus-dashboard.netlify.app/gc-dashboard/:splat   200!
